    21	
    22	- Figure 1's five-vertex “unit clique” allegedly omits chords `c_1c_4` and `c_2c_3`; the `C_t/sigma_*` label allegedly collides with dashed edges.
    23	- Since `5069/6439=37/47`, optionally rewrite `R_Q` with reduced rational part.
    24	- Abstract phrase “supremum of the fitness intervals `(1,R)`” could become “supremum of `R` such that ...”.
    25	- MSC `60J10` allegedly denotes discrete-time chains; consider adding `60J27` for continuous-time Markov chains.
    26	- Confirm CPython 3.14.6 is the actual pin.
